@startuml
title Auralis - Multi-Hearing-Device Audio Hub\nHigh-Level Laptop Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

actor User

package "Linux Laptop" {
    rectangle "Audio Sources" as Sources {
        component "System Audio\nBrowser / VLC / Music / Video" as SystemAudio
        component "Microphone" as Microphone
        component "Future External Audio\nUSB / Line-In" as ExternalAudio
    }

    package "Auralis Application\nC++20 + Qt 6" {
        component "Qt / QML UI" as UI
        component "Device Manager" as DeviceManager
        component "Audio Capture Engine" as CaptureEngine
        component "Audio Processing Engine" as ProcessingEngine
        component "Multi-Output Router" as OutputRouter
        component "Synchronization Engine" as SyncEngine
        component "Session Manager" as SessionManager
        component "Diagnostics & Metrics" as Diagnostics

        component "Device Output A\nRing Buffer + Delay" as OutputA
        component "Device Output B\nRing Buffer + Delay" as OutputB
        component "Device Output C\nRing Buffer + Delay" as OutputC
        component "Device Output N\nRing Buffer + Delay" as OutputN
    }

    package "Linux Audio & Bluetooth Layer" {
        component "PipeWire" as PipeWire
        component "BlueZ" as BlueZ
        component "D-Bus" as DBus
        component "Laptop Bluetooth Adapter" as BTAdapter
    }
}

cloud "Bluetooth Wireless Links" as BluetoothLinks
node "Hearing Device A" as HearingA
node "Hearing Device B" as HearingB
node "Hearing Device C" as HearingC
node "Hearing Device N" as HearingN

User --> UI : Scan / Pair / Connect\nStart / Stop Audio

SystemAudio --> PipeWire : System Audio
Microphone --> PipeWire : Audio
ExternalAudio --> PipeWire : Future Audio Input
PipeWire --> CaptureEngine : PCM Audio Capture

CaptureEngine --> ProcessingEngine : PCM Frames
ProcessingEngine --> OutputRouter : Normalized PCM
OutputRouter --> SyncEngine : Shared Audio Timeline

SyncEngine --> OutputA : Buffered PCM\nDelay Compensation
SyncEngine --> OutputB : Buffered PCM\nDelay Compensation
SyncEngine --> OutputC : Buffered PCM\nDelay Compensation
SyncEngine --> OutputN : Buffered PCM\nDelay Compensation

OutputA --> PipeWire : Output Stream A
OutputB --> PipeWire : Output Stream B
OutputC --> PipeWire : Output Stream C
OutputN --> PipeWire : Output Stream N

UI --> DeviceManager : Device Commands
DeviceManager --> DBus : Discovery / Pair /\nConnect / Disconnect
DBus --> BlueZ : Bluetooth Control
BlueZ --> BTAdapter : Connection Management
PipeWire --> BlueZ : Bluetooth Audio Sink Routing

BTAdapter --> BluetoothLinks
BluetoothLinks --> HearingA : Bluetooth Audio
BluetoothLinks --> HearingB : Bluetooth Audio
BluetoothLinks --> HearingC : Bluetooth Audio
BluetoothLinks --> HearingN : Bluetooth Audio

UI --> SessionManager : Playback Controls
SessionManager --> CaptureEngine : Start / Stop Capture
SessionManager --> OutputRouter : Configure Outputs
SessionManager --> SyncEngine : Start / Stop Sync
SessionManager --> DeviceManager : Device Session State

DeviceManager --> UI : Connection Status\nDevice Metadata
DeviceManager --> SyncEngine : Connected Device Set

CaptureEngine --> Diagnostics
ProcessingEngine --> Diagnostics
OutputRouter --> Diagnostics
SyncEngine --> Diagnostics
DeviceManager --> Diagnostics
Diagnostics --> UI : Latency / Buffer /\nDropouts / Errors

note right of SyncEngine
Core responsibilities:
- Per-device buffering
- Delay compensation
- Latency tracking
- Clock drift handling
- Resynchronization
end note

note right of DeviceManager
BlueZ/D-Bus control:
- Discovery
- Pairing
- Connection
- Disconnection
- Reconnection
- Device metadata
end note

note bottom of BTAdapter
Prototype:
Use laptop Bluetooth hardware first.
Fallback:
USB Bluetooth adapter if evidence
shows radio/adapter limitations.
end note
@enduml
